"""
Full analysis: PCA on 12 forms of capital in hundred-year slices (data/capital.csv),
characterising Middle Neolithic (3400-3000 BCE, 5 slices) vs Younger Neolithic
(2900-2300 BCE, 7 slices) on PC1. Controls: sample frame, standardisation, ZSichel.
Sensitivity: leave-one-slice-out / leave-one-indicator-out, ZMW outlier.
"""
